## What We Are Building

Four connected pieces on the live E13 parallel Mode-3 run:
1. **Reference-drawer cluster** — select-in-place variant pick (kill duplicate tiles),
   reject-on-APPROVED→REVISION (q1a), status-aware Approve footer.
2. **Kebab dossier → two zones** (REFERENCE {ref plan + image} / VIDEO {shot plan +
   video}) + Generate-video button made 3-way plan-aware.
3. **Fanout idempotency** — approving the 2nd pilot video was regenerating shots that
   were already done ("approve one tile → the whole episode regenerates").
4. **Excluded-shot as an explicit flag** — replace the ≤0.5s duration hack with a
   stage-independent `episodes.metadata.excluded_shot_ids` SSOT + kebab toggle, honored
   by stitch + generation + Polina's list. Plus **listShots** now returns per-shot video
   status + a `videoSummary` (the "which shots still need approval" list the Director
   had to compile by hand).

